    "la": "Opuscula minora Bernardi: Prologus in Antiphonarium (De cantu), Officium de S. Victore, Chartae, Opuscula duo, Formula confessionis, Parabolae, Sententiae.",
    "en-US": "Bernard’s shorter pieces gathered from Migne: the prologue to the Cistercian antiphonary (on chant), the office of Saint Victor, charters, two short opuscula, a formula of private confession, the Parables and the Sentences. The Latin is the Maurist text in Migne (Patrologia Latina 182–184). Latin only, from the Maurist text in Migne, a machine-corrected OCR.",
    "pt-BR": "Peças menores de Bernardo reunidas de Migne: o prólogo do antifonário cisterciense (sobre o canto), o ofício de São Vítor, cartas patentes, dois opúsculos, uma fórmula de confissão privada, as Parábolas e as Sentenças."
  },
